        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5059LSMRWH, White Marble Jasper Leverset with Disk Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Jasper White Marble Leverset is beautiful. The white marble adds a classic touch perfect for traditional decors. The Mid Century Modern White Marble Jasper Leverset with Disk Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  Use the White Marble L-Square Leverset with Disk Rose to enhance any room with its high-end silhouette.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis leverset utilizes real, natural marble. As a result, <b>each piece is unique and veining will vary</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSMRWH-Specifications.gif?v=1704354559\" width=\"600\" height=\"162\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek LS White Marble Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the White Marble Door Jasper Lever with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the White Marble L-Square Leverset with Disk Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Marble</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-LSMRWH-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262405\"><b>Emtek L-Square White Marble Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Jasper White Marble Leverset",
                "description": "The Jasper White Marble Leverset is beautiful. The white marble adds a classic touch perfect for traditional decors. The Mid Century Modern White Marble Jasper Leverset with Disk Rose is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.  Use the White Marble L-Square Leverset with Disk Rose to enhance any room with its high-end silhouette.",
                "keywords": "Jasper White Marble Leversets, Emtek 5059LSMRWH, EMT-5059LSMRWH, L-Square White Marble Lever with Disk Roses, White Marble L-Square Leverset with Disk Roses, White Marble Door Jasper Lever with Round Roses, White Marble Jasper Leverset with Disk Roses, Emtek 5059LSMRWH dummy levers, Emtek 5109LSMRWH passage levers, Emtek 5209LSMRWH privacy levers, mid century modern door hardware,"
            },
